xnu 0502: open glink and ask the adsp apm for its spf state

Port the zizhan GLINK transport and GPR codec (BSD-2-Clause-Patent,
QcomGlink.c/ShengGpr.c) into mondrian_glink.c, mondrian_glink.h,
mondrian_gpr.c and mondrian_gpr.h. After the slave-kernel ready bit the
ADSP worker allocates the APPS-ADSP GLINK items 478/479, opens the
"adsp_apps" channel as initiator (512-byte intents, 16 of them), sets the
SMEM receive FIFO once the DSP allocates item 480, and sends the GPR
APM_GET_SPF_STATE query from client port 0x2001 to APM port 1. It polls
for five seconds and logs the version handshake, channel state, every
reply and the final counters.
